  ],
  "notes": "Back view of a Waveshare display board with a 2x16 header and printed pin numbers. Labels use the GPIO name inside parentheses with the prefix (DN, DP, BOOT, TXD, RXD, SCL, SDA) in functions. Pin 8 is printed 'DP(DPIO20)' (likely typo for GPIO20); recorded as printed. Images 2 and 3 are the same artwork at lower resolution. Battery, speaker (SPK) connectors only have +/- marks and are skipped."
